  "description": "Introducing Varlo – A bold script font inspired by 80s and 90s Americana with a modern twist. Perfect for sports teams, bar logos, beer labels, or any project needing a strong, sturdy script with character, Varlo channels the excitement of baseball.\nWith opentype features like standard ligatures and contextual alternates, Varlo ensures smooth letter connections. Customize with swash or titling alternates and explore the glyph palette for more options.\nComplete your designs with Varlo ornaments, capturing the spirit of baseball perfectly.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Introducing Varlo – A bold script font inspired by 80s and 90s Americana with a modern twist. Perfect for sports teams, bar logos, beer labels, or any project needing a strong, sturdy script with character, Varlo channels the excitement of baseball.</p>\n<p>With opentype features like standard ligatures and contextual alternates, Varlo ensures smooth letter connections. Customize with swash or titling alternates and explore the glyph palette for more options.</p>\n<p>Complete your designs with Varlo ornaments, capturing the spirit of baseball perfectly.</p>",
